{
 "id": "p10022",
 "sents": [
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "A product manager",
     "m": "产品经理"
    },
    {
     "t": "works between different teams",
     "m": "在不同团队间工作"
    },
    {
     "t": "and helps everyone",
     "m": "并帮助大家"
    },
    {
     "t": "move toward the same goal.",
     "m": "朝同一目标前进"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "During the development",
     "m": "在开发期间"
    },
    {
     "t": "of our new account settings page,",
     "m": "新版账户设置页"
    },
    {
     "t": "I worked closely with",
     "m": "我密切合作"
    },
    {
     "t": "a product designer and two engineers.",
     "m": "一位设计师两位工程师"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "The designer first shared a prototype.",
     "m": "设计师先分享原型"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "I reviewed it",
     "m": "我先做评审"
    },
    {
     "t": "from the user's point of view",
     "m": "从用户角度"
    },
    {
     "t": "and checked whether",
     "m": "并检查"
    },
    {
     "t": "the main tasks were easy to complete.",
     "m": "主要任务是否好完成"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "I noticed that",
     "m": "我发现"
    },
    {
     "t": "the save button",
     "m": "保存按钮"
    },
    {
     "t": "was difficult to find",
     "m": "很难被注意到"
    },
    {
     "t": "on a mobile screen.",
     "m": "在手机屏幕上"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "We discussed the issue",
     "m": "我们讨论了问题"
    },
    {
     "t": "and moved the button",
     "m": "并移动按钮"
    },
    {
     "t": "to a more visible position.",
     "m": "到更醒目的位置"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "Then the engineers reviewed the design",
     "m": "随后工程师评审设计"
    },
    {
     "t": "and explained that",
     "m": "并解释说"
    },
    {
     "t": "one part would require changes",
     "m": "有一处要改动"
    },
    {
     "t": "to an older service.",
     "m": "涉及旧服务"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "This could increase the development time.",
     "m": "这可能延长开发时间"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "Instead of asking them",
     "m": "我没有强求他们"
    },
    {
     "t": "to follow the original plan without discussion,",
     "m": "不加讨论照原计划做"
    },
    {
     "t": "I asked which parts were technically difficult",
     "m": "而是问哪里难做"
    },
    {
     "t": "and whether there was a simpler option.",
     "m": "有无更简单的方案"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "We agreed to keep",
     "m": "我们决定保留"
    },
    {
     "t": "the most important settings",
     "m": "最重要的设置"
    },
    {
     "t": "in the first release",
     "m": "在首个版本里"
    },
    {
     "t": "and move a less common option",
     "m": "把不常用选项"
    },
    {
     "t": "to a later update.",
     "m": "挪到后续更新"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "I updated the requirements",
     "m": "我更新了需求"
    },
    {
     "t": "and made sure",
     "m": "并确保"
    },
    {
     "t": "the designer and engineers",
     "m": "设计师和工程师"
    },
    {
     "t": "were working from the same version.",
     "m": "用的是同一版本"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "During the project,",
     "m": "项目期间"
    },
    {
     "t": "I also shared decisions quickly",
     "m": "我及时分享决策"
    },
    {
     "t": "and recorded important changes.",
     "m": "并记录重要变更"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "Good collaboration",
     "m": "良好的协作"
    },
    {
     "t": "does not mean",
     "m": "并不意味着"
    },
    {
     "t": "that everyone always agrees.",
     "m": "大家总是意见一致"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "It means discussing different concerns early,",
     "m": "而是尽早谈顾虑"
    },
    {
     "t": "making decisions with clear reasons,",
     "m": "有理有据做决定"
    },
    {
     "t": "and keeping the team informed",
     "m": "并让团队知情"
    },
    {
     "t": "as the work changes.",
     "m": "随工作变化"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
